{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n1",
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process, Course Packet Information Received should be sent,"
      ],
      "justification": "Captures process initiation and the first two sequential transmission steps described in the opening clause."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "followed by sending the Design to Faculty."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match for the second ordered transmission step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:i3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After sending the Design to Faculty, the Faculty will choose the design."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact textual copy mapping to the faculty selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, identify the content that requires copyright clearance and contact the publisher to obtain clearance."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully paraphrases the copyright identification and publisher outreach step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the denial decision path and its notification action. The guard abstracts the condition to a variable value without altering the branching behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n7",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the cleared decision path and the subsequent cost calculation step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After calculating the Course Packet Cost, the MPC should add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly captures the margin addition step following cost calculation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the price reduction reconsideration path and continuation action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if the Price of the Course Packet is finalized, then the MPC should notify the Bookstore of the Course packet, Course number, Faculty name, and sections."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the price finalization path and captures all specified notification details."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "converge:c_loop"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued.",
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Structural element representing the join point where both continuation loops re-enter the main flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the MPC notifies the Bookstore, the Packet information should be notified to the Bookstore, and the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the final packet notification step and process termination."
    }
  ],
